The Codex JSON-RPC transport, application-function handoff, and local provider
discovery design were extracted and adapted from the project owner's Cursor
Blinking implementation, in particular:

  runtimes/local-connector/providers/codex/
  runtimes/local-connector/providers/ollama/
  runtimes/platform-ai-sidecars/codex-bridge/

The gateway, persistence, public protocol and framework-independent console are
maintained in this repository. No blog account database, private configuration,
frontend template, model weights or third-party runtime binaries are distributed.

Codex, Ollama and model/provider names identify separate third-party products.
Their licenses, account conditions and service policies apply independently.
This project is not endorsed by those providers.

The model-management layout and interaction patterns are also adapted from
client/components/admin/PersonalModelCapabilityManager.js and the associated
model-capability controls, views and styles in the same source project. The
independent client-demo implementation owns standalone/grouped application
features, model choices and reasoning preferences. The server console owns
model supply, publication and project authorization.
